@UserApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### 健康检查
GET {{UserApi_HostAddress}}/health

###

### 注册（注册是创建用户的唯一途径；成功即签发 token 自动登录，ADR-0005）
POST {{UserApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123"
}

###

### 登录（dev 种子账号：demo@travel.local / Demo@123456）
POST {{UserApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@travel.local",
  "password": "Demo@123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 当前用户档案（需 Bearer）
GET {{UserApi_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 修改本人资料（邮箱冲突返回 409）
PUT {{UserApi_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Demo User",
  "email": "demo@travel.local",
  "phoneNumber": "13800000000",
  "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.example.com/a.png"
}

###

### 修改本人密码（校验当前密码）
PUT {{UserApi_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "Demo@123456",
  "newPassword": "NewPass@123456"
}
